Now interestingly, and we're showing this
to our video audience, I'll try to describe

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.399
it to our radio and podcast audience.

00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:45.399
If you were to draw a straight line across
Joe Biden's polling, which is the green line,

00:00:45.399 --> 00:00:49.199
