If you do the same with Bernie's polling,
the light blue line, you see that he is roughly

00:01:02.469 --> 00:01:08.860
where he was in early may, but if you look
at Elizabeth Warren, you see a much bigger

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:14.840
upswing in the earlier part of this year and
they pretty direct downfalls starting uh,

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:21.240
with her peak in the first week of October
around 27%, almost actually tied for first

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:27.770
place with Joe Biden down to where she is
today at 15, just barely more than half of

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:29.720
the support she wants had.

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:34.850
Now, if you look at the recent individual
